      "message": "1. For mobile phone customer manufacturers, they want to mass produce quickly.\n2. At present, only this EP wifi is encountered. Its internal bus is not stable enough, and there will be a problem of read completion timeout. At this time, if the AP is a mobile phone platform, if the kernel panics, the wifi firmware log cannot be saved and the wifi status cannot be debugged. Only the AP platform can find a way to avoid kernel panic.\n3. The infra bus cannot turn off the slave error monitoring, after all, there are other modules to be monitored.\n\nThis is not a common problem, nor is it a problem with the AP platform. The AP platform is set for this wifi provided by the customer mobile phone provider, and does not need submitted upstream.",
